@startuml
autonumber
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome false

' === SAGE GREEN THEME ===
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #788AA3
    ActorBorderColor #788AA3
    ActorBackgroundColor #B2C9AB
    ActorFontColor #46495D
    
    ParticipantBorderColor #788AA3
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #B2C9AB
    ParticipantFontColor #46495D
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
    
    LifeLineBorderColor #788AA3
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #B2C9AB
    
    BoxBorderColor #788AA3
    BoxBackgroundColor #B2C9AB
    BoxFontColor #46495D
}
' =================================

actor "Job Seeker / Guest" as User
participant "React Web Client\n(SPA)" as Client
participant "Laravel API Gateway\n(JobPostingController)" as API
database "MySQL Database\n(job_postings)" as DB

User -> Client: 1. Input search keywords & select filter facets (Location, Salary, Type)
activate Client

Client -> API: 2. GET /api/jobs?keyword=...&department=...&workplace=...
activate API

API -> DB: 3. Query active job listings (WHERE status='active' AND criteria MATCH)
activate DB
DB --> API: 4. Return matching records & company relationship data
deactivate DB

API --> Client: 5. HTTP 200 OK (JSON array of job vacancy cards & total count)
deactivate API

Client --> User: 6. Dynamically render job vacancy cards & company badges
deactivate Client
@enduml
